{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-gs-quotient-ideals-I8-I9","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:gs-quotient-ideals-I8-I9","kind":"definition","title":"Quotient ideals $I_8$ (adjacency correlation) and $I_9$ (closed-shell chain collapse)","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-shell-closure-normal-form"],"tags":["groebner-basis","quotient-ideal","normal-form","transfer-matrix","hecke-algebra","nuclear-structure"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.OptimalNF.GSQuotientIdealsI8I9","text":"gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9.md","leanSource":"gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:gs-quotient-ideals-I8-I9\"></a><p>The <strong>quotient ideals</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">I_8</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">I_9</code> act on the Gröbner--Shirshov normal form (<a href=\"#prop:shell-closure-normal-form\" data-at=\"predicted-spectra/atomic-shells-foundations\">shell closure normal form</a>) as follows:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>I<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">_{8}</code> (adjacency correlation):</strong> a reduced word <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_i \\sigma_{i+1}</code> of length 2 is absorbed into <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_{i+1}</code> when the latter is present in the normal form.</li>\n<li><strong>I<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">_{9}</code> (closed shell chain collapse):</strong> a reduced word <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">w \\cdot \\sigma_j</code> is absorbed when its prefix <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">w</code> is present in the normal form.</li>\n</ul>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9.md","heading":"Definition","number":"16.14.11","page":"b/def-gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9","qa":{"counts":{"pass":80,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":63},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.OptimalNF.GSQuotientIdealsI8I9","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/gs-quotient-ideals-i8-i9.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
